heks-toon (0.3.9-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: the palette picker follows heks-linux 4 and whelk,
    and every palette card in the chooser calls a program that exists.
  * Packaged here rather than upstream: heks-toon ships no packaging of its
    own, so this recipe is the first one.
  * Meson builds the C half and installs the Guile modules under
    share/guile/site/3.0, the desktop entry, the AppStream metainfo and the
    icon; there is no configure step of our own.

 -- Josep Bigorra <jjbigorra@gmail.com>  Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0100
